00:20:59.773 --> 00:21:02.410
Then the printed story is checked
against the original story

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:04.350
to make certain that
there are no mistakes.

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:05.183
Warning light.

00:21:05.183 --> 00:21:06.820
The presses are starting to roll.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:08.350
Newspapers are sold on the streets,

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:10.130
newspapers are delivered to homes,

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:11.633
and they are read everywhere.

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:16.533
I like my job, helping to bring
the news to our community.

